source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Show one customer's cohort + realised LTV + revenue timeline

Usage: vendo measurement ltv customer [OPTIONS] <customerId>

Arguments:
  <customerId>  

Options:
      --json  Output raw JSON
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo measurement ltv customer cust_abc123
  $ vendo measurement ltv customer cust_abc123 --json
